mineflayer bots are very hook-oriented
they need:
- a way to interact with each other
    perhaps a ros-like communication protocol?

- a way to interact with their environment
    mineflayer provides this!

- we also want a way to programmatically define behavior, and to hotswap
this behavior - probably a controller class that sets hooks or something
like that

what is a behavior?
- has a trigger (an event)
- has world parameters (info associated with the trigger)
- has internal parameters (info set by the program)
- has a response (method affected by internal and external parameters)

